WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is really cool --
your parents are backstage.

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:02.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-They flew out from Australia

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:04.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
because you've got
two premieres this week.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.806
You have this film, and then,
you have a film, "Gringo,"

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:10.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you're in, that
your brother, Nash, directed,

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:10.844 size:78% position:39% line:92%
which is really cool.

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:12.779
And you guys have
worked together over the years,

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:15.181
but this is the first time,
obviously, he's directed

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:16.916 size:78% position:39% line:92%
a big American movie.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
How was that?
-It was awesome.

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:20.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean,
as Nash said the other day,

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:21.721 line:92%
he's been bossing me around

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:24.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
and directing me
since I was, like, a kid.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:24.924 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:28.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then we both get paid
to live out that same dynamic.

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And he did a great job.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
We played the movie
in Miami the other night.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.034 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It went down like crazy.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's about a guy
who gets kidnapped in Mexico,

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
a guy who works for
a pharmaceutical corporation.

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:43.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
Charlize Theron and I
play these corporate jerks,

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:45.979 line:92%
which is strangely easy to play.

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:47.080 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:50.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
For Charlize.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.251 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Bigger stretch for me.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:53.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
And -- And it was --
It's amazing.

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:58.091
And I really encourage everybody
to go see...all of my movies.

00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:59.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, well, I want to say,

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:02.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause we've talked about
your brother before.

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:04.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're also
a wonderful director,

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:07.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I know you're working
on something else right now.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, I am.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:11.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your brother, though --
Like, a lot of actors direct.

00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:13.773 line:92%
Your brother is a stunt man.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:16.276 line:92%
-Well, he started as a stunt guy

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:19.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then became an editor
and then a director.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So I guess what
I'm saying is, like,

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:21.681 line:92%
you went from actor to director.

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:22.515 line:92%
I've heard about that before.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
Your brother,
that's kind of mind-blowing.

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:26.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
If there's someone
I'm impressed with...

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:28.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Mm.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:30.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, stunt man...
Actor, director.

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:33.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, if you go
from nail salon to director,

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.361 line:92%
that would be slightly more...

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, he is
a very impressive director.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:41.234 size:88% position:44%
My brother -- and I hate
to pay him a compliment

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
on live TV,
but I'm going to look down

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:43.937 line:92%
the barrel of the camera.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:48.374
Pretty much anything he puts his
mind to, he does very well.

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:49.008 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That's fantastic,

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:51.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
and so lucky that you guys
get to work together.

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:53.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm very --
I'm very jealous of that.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:55.982
I want to close,
because we've done this before.

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:57.884
You've been on the show --
I think this is the fourth time,

00:01:57.884 --> 00:01:59.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we've busted you
on some outfits.

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:00.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-The last time you were here,

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
I pointed out,
these are two different times

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:05.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
you were wearing this sweat --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:08.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's literally like
you're going out, thinking,

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:09.896 line:92%
"I hope someone takes a picture

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:11.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
for the next time
I'm on 'Late Night.'"

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:12.999 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:13.666 size:75% position:38% line:92%
And yet here you go.

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:15.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're out again --
This was the latest.

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:17.470 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You're on a beach.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:21.274
I guess, based on the hat,
in the middle of winter.

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:22.142 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:25.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No wonder
I would make a terrible spy.

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:26.246 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:28.148 align:start size:94% position:6%
"No one's gonna see me.
No one's gonna..."

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:29.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm wearing
the same sweater, right?

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:30.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But, you know,
I thought you were,

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.920
but then, look --
it's a slightly different logo.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.021 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:36.656 size:88% position:44% line:92%
So you've got a new one.

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:39.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When you are sponsored...
-You're sponsored?

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:42.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...they update you.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:43.863 line:92%
-But you're trying to strip me

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:44.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
of my sponsorship here
by ridiculing me.

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:47.700
-They sponsored you,
and they were so good with this,

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.936 size:84% position:42%
they said, "We've got
to give him a new one?"

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:51.638 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.638 --> 00:02:52.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know what?
I promise you, next time

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:55.508
I come on your show, I'm just
gonna wear one of these outfits.

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:57.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Please!
-Forget all this.

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:59.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Forget this.
This isn't the real Joel.

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:00.480 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It doesn't feel like me.
-I want to meet the real Joel.

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:03.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
-All right.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:05.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
I can't wait.
-The real Joel is coming.

00:03:05.418 --> 00:03:06.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Always such a pleasure
to talk to you.

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:08.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much.
-Thank you.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:10.223 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Congrats on everything.

